r this character  in an audition video that was leaked  online now because of that video  i received my first copyright strike not  only that but hbo had my whole video  taken down so no one else would see it  i believe the actor's name is feroz  durrani  some of you should remember seeing that  video before hbo had it removed  the reason why i am mentioning this is  because i know a lot of you did not like  that actor  or at least not his audition well now  you don't have to worry  because he did not get the job i do not  recognize this actor  fabian frankel who did get the job so  i'm not sure how good he will be either  the way i see it is hbo did an amazing  job at casting game of thrones so i have  faith they will get great actors and  actresses for house of the dragon as  well  now if you have seen some of this  actor's work let me know what you think  of him down below  i am always interested in seeing what  all of you have to say  there were some whispers that house of  the dragon would begin filming on april  15th which was only a few days ago  i haven't seen any new updates or  developments about this as of yet  so i still don't know if filming has  begun whenever filming does actually  begin  there will start to be lots of photos  and videos leaked from the different  sets  which i will make videos on anytime i  get my hands on them  so be on the lookout for those as well  now i want to show you what else george  rr martin said  on his not a blog website because some  of you might find it to be interesting  depending on how you look at it first i  just want to give nerd roddick a shout  out  i did not know george even made this  update until i saw his video  now there are some fans who think this  next update  might mean that george r martin is  finished with the winds of winter  since the message is from george himself  you're gonna have to read between the  lines to figure out exactly what he  means by this  chances are it doesn't mean anything but  hey we can all dream of spring  can't we let me show you what he said  way back when on live journal  when i started this column or journal or  whatever it is  i named it my not a blog because i could  see that regular blogging was a lot of  work  and i didn't think i had the time to  devote to it i was late on a book even  then  though i do not recall which one i  figured i would just give some updates  from time to time  when i had an important announcement  when the mood struck me or whatever  somehow though over the decades the nada  blog became a blog  and what i had intended as an occasional  pleasure and a way to stay in touch with  my readers  has become a blog ironically at the same  time as everyone else was abandoning  their blogs for facebook  complete with a sense of obligation and  when a lot of stuff happens  very fast i fall further and further  behind  i am hugely behind right now and the  thought of trying to catch up is feeling  increasingly oppressive  my life has become one of extremes these  last few months  some days i do not know whether to cry  or laugh to shoot off fireworks and  dance in the streets  or crawl back into bed and lift the  covers over my head  the good stuff that has been happening  to me has been very very very good  the kind of thing that will make a year  or a career  but the bad stuff that is happening has  been very very very bad  and it is hard to cherish the good and  feel the joy when the shadows are all  around  if any of you read the stories about me  on the internet you will know my good  news  i have a new 5-year deal with hbo to  create  new game of thrones successor shows and  some non-related series like road marks  for both hbo and hbo max it's an  incredible deal  an amazing deal very exciting and i want  to tell you all about it  although it seems that the media has  already done that there's already  stories in all the trades  you can read about it here these days i  almost never get to break any news about  m