r dre  than we are to get the winds of winter  from george rr martin  then again i know nothing now if you do  want to see how game of thrones should  have ended  make sure you check out all of the  season 9 videos on my channel  i will be releasing more episodes very  soon  as always i want to thank everyone for  watching my video  i hope all of you have a great day i'll  see you soon  bye  [Music]  you

